hi-062","work_id":"w-sanguozhi","source_id":"s-sanguozhi-062-huzong"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-062-xuxiang:line048","text":"　　徐詳者字子明，吳郡烏程人也，先綜死。","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-sanguozhi-062-xuxiang:line048:m0002","start":2,"end":4,"surface":"徐詳","kind":"person","person_id":"28m_ezf_3e7","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-062-xuxiang:line048:m0006","start":6,"end":8,"surface":"子明","kind":"person","person_id":"28m_ezf_3e7","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-062-xuxiang:line048:m0017","start":17,"end":18,"surface":"綜","kind":"person","person_id":"qfk_09j_fhe","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。"}],"annotation_status":"reviewed","source_position":{"first_line":48,"last_line":48,"revision_id":2623289,"raw_start":4448,"raw_end":4468,"character_positions":[4448,4449,4450,4451,4452,4453,4454,4455,4456,4457,4458,4459,4460,4461,4462,4463,4464,4465,4466,4467]},"chapter_id":"c-sanguozhi-062-xuxiang","book_id":"b-sanguozhi-062","work_id":"w-sanguozhi","source_id":"s-sanguozhi-062-xuxiang"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-064-zhugeke-complete:p004","text":"《江表傳》曰：權為吳王，初置節度官，使典掌軍糧，非漢制也。初用侍中偏將軍徐詳，詳死，將用恪。諸葛亮聞恪代詳，書與陸遜曰：「家兄年老，而恪性疏，今使典主糧穀，糧穀軍之要最，僕雖在遠，竊用不安。足下特為啟至尊轉之。」遜以白權，即轉恪領兵。","text_layer":"witness_appended_pei_songzhi_note","annotation_status":"reviewed","source_position":{"first_line":12,"last_line":12,"raw_start":1174,"raw_end":1295,"raw_character_offsets":[1174,1177,1178,1179,1182,1183,1184,1185,1186,1187,1188,1189,1190,1191,1192,1193,1194,1195,1196,1197,1198,1199,1200,1201,1202,1203,1204,1205,1206,1207,1208,1209,1210,1211,1212,1213,1214,1215,1216,1217,1218,1219,1220,1221,1222,1223,1224,1225,1226,1227,1228,1229,1230,1231,1232,1233,1234,1235,1236,1237,1238,1239,1240,1241,1242,1243,1244,1245,1246,1247,1248,1249,1250,1251,1252,1253,1254,1255,1256,1257,1258,1259,1260,1261,1262,1263,1264,1265,1266,1267,1268,1269,1270,1271,1272,1273,1274,